1149
01:03:38,560 --> 01:03:41,060
Got to learn a lot of things about them that I didn't know,

1150
01:03:41,060 --> 01:03:43,600
so that was exciting as well.

1151
01:03:43,600 --> 01:03:45,680
Went to the SMD Conference,

1152
01:03:45,680 --> 01:03:48,240
and I've had a couple of people ask me,

1153
01:03:48,240 --> 01:03:49,760
why did I support the TIF?

1154
01:03:50,760 --> 01:03:54,280
I supported the TIF because when you go to the conference

1155
01:03:54,280 --> 01:03:59,200
and every hallway, our way space in the Civic Center

1156
01:03:59,200 --> 01:04:03,800
is occupied by vendors who support space

1157
01:04:03,800 --> 01:04:06,700
in the SMD Conference, who have companies.

1158
01:04:06,700 --> 01:04:10,080
I saw firsthand last year, the need.

1159
01:04:10,080 --> 01:04:14,920
This year, they had to turn away vendors.

1160
01:04:14,920 --> 01:04:17,080
And when you have to turn away vendors,

1161
01:04:17,080 --> 01:04:20,000
that means that it's a really successful forum.

1162
01:04:20,000 --> 01:04:23,680
And I'm supporting it because if we want to attract

1163
01:04:23,680 --> 01:04:27,120
large venues, large forums, large symposiums,

1164
01:04:27,120 --> 01:04:29,000
we have to have the space.

1165
01:04:29,800 --> 01:04:31,400
So that is why I'm supporting the TIF,

1166
01:04:31,400 --> 01:04:34,240
and that is one of the reasons why I like going

1167
01:04:34,240 --> 01:04:35,200
to the conference.

1168
01:04:35,200 --> 01:04:37,400
I like learning new things that's going on

1169
01:04:37,400 --> 01:04:39,400
in space and missile defense,

1170
01:04:39,400 --> 01:04:41,800
but at the same time, we have to be able to support them

1171
01:04:41,800 --> 01:04:43,280
if we're gonna bring them here.

1172
01:04:43,280 --> 01:04:45,360
And not just them, anybody who wants to bring

1173
01:04:45,360 --> 01:04:46,660
a major conference here.

1174
01:04:47,600 --> 01:04:51,880
Tuesday, we had a meeting in Northwoods Public Housing

1175
01:04:51,880 --> 01:04:54,160
to talk about the future of Northwoods

1176
01:04:54,160 --> 01:04:56,200
and the university corridor.

1177
01:04:56,240 --> 01:04:59,080
And I was really disappointed.

1178
01:04:59,080 --> 01:05:00,480
