1179
01:05:00,480 --> 01:05:04,180
So I'm going to have another meeting just so I can make sure

1180
01:05:04,180 --> 01:05:07,000
that the residents and the public have input

1181
01:05:07,000 --> 01:05:09,480
in this proposed plan.

1182
01:05:09,480 --> 01:05:13,320
The Celebrating Education Parade will be on August 22nd.

1183
01:05:13,320 --> 01:05:16,240
If you have never been to the Celebrating Education Parade,

1184
01:05:16,240 --> 01:05:17,480
I would encourage you to come.

1185
01:05:17,480 --> 01:05:18,920
It's a lot of fun.

1186
01:05:18,920 --> 01:05:21,320
A lot of schools participate.

1187
01:05:21,320 --> 01:05:22,440
Everyone comes together.

1188
01:05:22,440 --> 01:05:24,180
The kids have a great time.

1189
01:05:24,180 --> 01:05:25,920
We start at ASFL.

1190
01:05:25,920 --> 01:05:27,520
We end at Jemison High School.

1191
01:05:27,520 --> 01:05:30,760
And once we get to Jemison, we have activities there.

1192
01:05:30,760 --> 01:05:32,080
So it's a lot of fun.

1193
01:05:32,080 --> 01:05:33,360
Hope you can make it out.

1194
01:05:35,140 --> 01:05:37,000
I hope the students had a great week.

1195
01:05:37,000 --> 01:05:38,560
Start back to school this week.

1196
01:05:38,560 --> 01:05:41,640
Wanna remind everyone, please pay attention

1197
01:05:41,640 --> 01:05:45,140
