1200
01:05:50,620 --> 01:05:53,400
You never know when a child is gonna jump out

1201
01:05:53,400 --> 01:05:54,440
in front of a car.

1202
01:05:54,680 --> 01:05:55,760
And if you're going too fast,

1203
01:05:55,760 --> 01:05:58,320
