1204
01:05:58,320 --> 01:06:01,040
So please, during seven and eight o'clock,

1205
01:06:01,040 --> 01:06:02,480
well, 8.30 for high schools,

1206
01:06:02,480 --> 01:06:04,720
please pay attention to the school zones.

1207
01:06:04,720 --> 01:06:07,040
I wanna thank Landscape Management,

1208
01:06:07,040 --> 01:06:11,680
Shane Davis, Public Works, HPD, as well as our firefighters.

1209
01:06:11,680 --> 01:06:13,080
Thank you for everything you do.

1210
01:06:13,080 --> 01:06:14,080
That's all I have.

1211
01:06:15,360 --> 01:06:16,340
Thank you, Ms. Watkins.

1212
01:06:16,340 --> 01:06:18,480
Mr. Kling, we'll hear from you next.

1213
01:06:18,480 --> 01:06:20,080
Thank you, Madam President.

1214
01:06:20,080 --> 01:06:23,240
Over the past weekend, I had a chance to go out

1215
01:06:23,240 --> 01:06:26,640
