1223
01:06:45,360 --> 01:06:47,600
that are already coming his way.

1224
01:06:47,600 --> 01:06:49,280
But it was a chance to see things,

1225
01:06:49,280 --> 01:06:50,840
and I think we're all getting to that point.

1226
01:06:50,840 --> 01:06:52,880
It's hot.

1227
01:06:52,880 --> 01:06:53,720
I know it's hot.

1228
01:06:53,720 --> 01:06:55,280
I'm out there every day it's hot.

1229
01:06:55,280 --> 01:06:57,840
But around the corner, it's gonna start cooling off,

1230
01:06:57,840 --> 01:07:01,120
and we're gonna start talking and thinking about football.

1231
01:07:01,120 --> 01:07:03,200
And this is gonna be coming,

1232
01:07:03,200 --> 01:07:06,080
and we got our high school football teams.

1233
01:07:06,080 --> 01:07:08,040
They are practicing now in the heat,

1234
01:07:08,040 --> 01:07:10,600
and they're getting ready for fall football.

1235
01:07:10,600 --> 01:07:12,960
And it's gonna be a great season.

1236
01:07:12,960 --> 01:07:14,320
I had a great time.

1237
01:07:14,320 --> 01:07:17,920
Also had a chance to see Mark Russell,

1238
01:07:17,920 --> 01:07:19,720
head of the Huntsville Sports Commission.

1239
01:07:19,720 --> 01:07:21,040
He was out there.

1240
01:07:21,040 --> 01:07:25,120
And again, a lot of great things are taking place

1241
01:07:25,120 --> 01:07:26,400
on that school campus.

1242
01:07:26,400 --> 01:07:29,280
So I'm excited, go Panthers.

1243
01:07:29,280 --> 01:07:31,400
Also a couple capital projects

1244
01:07:31,400 --> 01:07:32,720
that I know we're gonna be talking about

1245
01:07:32,720 --> 01:07:33,880
when we get into the budget

1246
01:07:33,880 --> 01:07:37,480
that impact the district that I'm excited about.

1247
01:07:37,480 --> 01:07:41,840
One is the Holmes Avenue Urban Park Corridor Project.

1248
01:07:41,840 --> 01:07:45,620
That's gonna be going from roughly downtown

1249
01:07:45,620 --> 01:07:50,680
under the overpass at the parkway, further west to UAH,

1250
01:07:50,680 --> 01:07:53,720
and then an additional section will go from UAH

1251
01:07:53,720 --> 01:07:55,500
