1252
01:07:55,500 --> 01:07:57,840
This is gonna be a stretched out urban park

1253
01:07:57,840 --> 01:08:02,160
with a jogging lane, bicycle path, park benches,

1254
01:08:02,160 --> 01:08:07,160
beautiful landscaping, bus stops, low-level lighting,

1255
01:08:07,320 --> 01:08:10,420
and it's gonna be something that people can use.

1256
01:08:10,420 --> 01:08:13,700
You could walk from UAH, stop, read a book

1257
01:08:13,700 --> 01:08:16,460
for a little while, and continue on downtown.

1258
01:08:16,460 --> 01:08:18,800
And I think that's gonna be a great project.

1259
01:08:19,040 --> 01:08:21,000
A citizen contacted me and told me

1260
01:08:21,000 --> 01:08:23,520
