1272
01:08:54,880 --> 01:08:58,560
but this would be a way to bring recognition to that area.

1273
01:08:58,560 --> 01:09:00,200
Another thing I wanted to mention,

1274
01:09:00,200 --> 01:09:03,160
I know we've all been hearing from people about the library.

1275
01:09:03,160 --> 01:09:05,000
Can we get the water fountain fixed?

1276
01:09:05,000 --> 01:09:08,040
