1279
01:09:13,560 --> 01:09:16,400
I know we've had a meeting with them,

1280
01:09:16,960 --> 01:09:18,200
and we've heard from them in the past,

1281
01:09:18,200 --> 01:09:20,920
but I think we're looking at three options,

1282
01:09:20,920 --> 01:09:22,600
