1285
01:09:28,360 --> 01:09:32,240
Are they looking at building a new library at that location?

1286
01:09:32,240 --> 01:09:34,520
Or the third alternative,

1287
01:09:34,520 --> 01:09:36,600
are they looking at building a new library

1288
01:09:36,600 --> 01:09:38,400
elsewhere in the city?

1289
01:09:38,400 --> 01:09:40,600
I think there's a lot of interest.

1290
01:09:40,600 --> 01:09:44,300
