01:10:11,420 --> 01:10:14,680
built in the extreme south and extreme north,

1302
01:10:14,680 --> 01:10:16,740
and I think we're certainly gonna be looking

1303
01:10:16,740 --> 01:10:19,380
at doing something good in the center part,

1304
01:10:19,380 --> 01:10:22,160
but we just need to get that plan of action,

1305
01:10:22,160 --> 01:10:24,200
that communication with the city council

1306
01:10:24,200 --> 01:10:27,580
and the library board, the director and the mayor,

1307
01:10:27,580 --> 01:10:30,460
and everybody all together on the same sheet of music,

1308
01:10:30,460 --> 01:10:34,700
and then see what the capital plan placement

1309
01:10:34,700 --> 01:10:36,340
would be on such action.

1310
01:10:36,340 --> 01:10:38,200
