3073
02:31:06,980 --> 02:31:09,980
Okay, so you would be open to that?

3074
02:31:09,980 --> 02:31:13,980
Yes, absolutely. So we'll look forward to hearing from you. Please contact the council office.

3075
02:31:13,980 --> 02:31:14,980
