Good evening.

3247
02:47:14,980 --> 02:47:18,980
My name is Dr. Angela Somerset and I reside in Chalkstone Street, Huntsville, Alabama.

3248
02:47:18,980 --> 02:47:20,980
Welcome, Dr. Somerset.

3249
02:47:20,980 --> 02:47:31,980
This evening, I basically have a question based on a prior city council meeting that occurred on May 28, 2026.

3250
02:47:31,980 --> 02:47:39,980
Our director of finance, Miss Penny Smith, came before the council and she stated that Huntsville Utilities pilot payments,

3251
02:47:39,980 --> 02:47:49,980
which stands for payment in lieu of taxes for the electric side that's based on assets, had a deficit of $4 million.

3252
02:47:49,980 --> 02:47:55,980
To date, I don't know what that means.

3253
02:47:55,980 --> 02:47:59,980
She did say that it was based on a tenant change.

3254
02:47:59,980 --> 02:48:03,980
So I would like to know at some point who is that tenant?

3255
02:48:03,980 --> 02:48:05,980
What is that tenant?

3256
02:48:05,980 --> 02:48:08,980
But let me tell you why it matters.

3257
02:48:08,980 --> 02:48:13,980
For many of you in the room, you know that I am an advocate about the utilities.

3258
02:48:13,980 --> 02:48:17,980
We have all experienced Huntsville Utilities.

3259
02:48:17,980 --> 02:48:27,980
But unexplained deficits erodes the public's trust in the utilities management as well as potentially the council's oversight.

3260
02:48:27,980 --> 02:48:30,980
Our councils vote for board members.

3261
02:48:30,980 --> 02:48:35,980
I have never seen a board member come in to ever explain any deficit.

3262
02:48:35,980 --> 02:48:42,980
And although those boards are there, they still are elected by our council.

3263
02:48:42,980 --> 02:48:48,980
And on August 25th, there will be another election for three of our council members.

3264
02:48:48,980 --> 02:48:57,980
I have asked now for years to make our utility company more accountable and transparent in terms of those books.

3265
02:48:57,980 --> 02:49:02,980
And their ultimate goal is to try to merge gas, water, and electric.

3266
02:49:02,980 --> 02:49:10,980
If we are not getting answers on $4 million deficits in the middle of the year based on assets,

3267
02:49:10,980 --> 02:49:13,980
something is definitely wrong.

3268
02:49:13,980 --> 02:49:25,980
So my concern, I've stated, but what I would like is a specific itemized accounting of that $4 million gap.

3269
02:49:25,980 --> 02:49:31,980
Not a general statement, not someone that comes in and just spreads over it.

3270
02:49:31,980 --> 02:49:36,980
We need to know as citizens because we own Huntsville Utilities.

3271
02:49:36,980 --> 02:49:37,980
Thank you.

3272
02:49:38,980 --> 02:49:39,980
Thank you, Dr. Somerset.

