And that's true. But what we haven't mentioned tonight, except kind of obliquely, was an acknowledgement about the rising operation costs, including utilities,

3299
02:51:45,980 --> 02:51:54,980
which, while they may not have increased this year, they did increase last year, along with water, sewage and everything else in the ballooning population of the area.

3300
02:51:54,980 --> 02:51:57,980
I mean, every meeting we're here, we're annexing, we're talking about folks.

3301
02:51:57,980 --> 02:52:00,980
Huntsville is in Limestone County now. I didn't even know that.

3302
02:52:00,980 --> 02:52:02,980
I did not realize Huntsville City is in Limestone County.

3303
02:52:02,980 --> 02:52:07,980
So that's two counties now that the Huntsville Madison County's library serves.

3304
02:52:07,980 --> 02:52:12,980
Costs everywhere have gone up and somehow it falls on the library to conjure this money.

3305
02:52:12,980 --> 02:52:17,980
So anyone who knows me knows that when I smell a rat, I go hunting for it.

3306
02:52:17,980 --> 02:52:30,980
And I have no reason to believe that the library board was lying to us when they said that operation costs forced them to pause cost of living raises, tighten budgets and reduce staffing hours.

3307
02:52:30,980 --> 02:52:36,980
I have every reason to think they're doing their best in these incredibly trying time for libraries.

3308
02:52:37,980 --> 02:52:48,980
And I think they can continue to do more and more for now two counties worth of service population if they are granted adequate funds with which to make these decisions.

3309
02:52:48,980 --> 02:52:52,980
The fact is we don't live in a vacuum.

3310
02:52:52,980 --> 02:53:00,980
You can give them, we can give the board a certain amount of money, but if all the costs are going up and our cost of living are going up,

3311
02:53:01,980 --> 02:53:08,980
I mean, I work 40 hours and live paycheck to paycheck and nobody should be living working 40 hours and living paycheck to paycheck.

3312
02:53:08,980 --> 02:53:10,980
Nobody. And I'm a manager.

3313
02:53:10,980 --> 02:53:13,980
So thank you.

3314
02:53:13,980 --> 02:53:14,980
Thank you, Alex.

3315
02:53:14,980 --> 02:53:20,980
We'll hear now from Chad Chavez and I believe he is our last speaker.

3316
02:53:20,980 --> 02:53:23,980
Hi, my name is Chad Chavez.

3317
02:53:23,980 --> 02:53:26,980
I live at 7512 Club Field Drive.

3318
02:53:26,980 --> 02:53:31,980
I wanted to speak about flock cameras initially, but previous speakers have covered this pretty well.

3319
02:53:31,980 --> 02:53:38,980
But I did want to address the concerns about the reasons the city's given for denying audit requests.

3320
02:53:38,980 --> 02:53:47,980
I also requested audit logs from the flock database acts tracking flock database access through open records requests.

3321
02:53:47,980 --> 02:53:53,980
And they were denied under investigative privilege the same way the city has denied body camera release in the past.

3322
02:53:53,980 --> 02:53:59,980
Despite these being pre-generated reports in flock meant specifically for auditing purposes.

3323
02:53:59,980 --> 02:54:02,980
Now, my preference is that these devices are just not deployed.

3324
02:54:02,980 --> 02:54:09,980
But barring that, heavy oversight is needed because these databases can make it easy to stalk unsuspecting victims,

3325
02:54:09,980 --> 02:54:22,980
to track peaceful protesters, or for federal law enforcement like ICE to follow immigrant communities like the ones Mayor Battle thanked earlier this meeting without a warrant or even without cause.

3326
02:54:22,980 --> 02:54:26,980
To demonstrate the need of an actual council rule instead of vague promises,

3327
02:54:26,980 --> 02:54:38,980
I did want to address the response to public safety policy and procedure recommendations previously put forward after review of violence against civil rights protesters here in Huntsville.

3328
02:54:38,980 --> 02:54:47,980
The then police chief promised that policies would be updated and posted through Power DMS.

3329
02:54:47,980 --> 02:54:55,980
So that that would be the live version both that the police department and citizens could view as those policies rolled out.

3330
02:54:55,980 --> 02:54:58,980
That is still listed on this city's website.

3331
02:54:58,980 --> 02:55:02,980
If you click through to the Power DMS links, that's now a 404 error.

3332
02:55:02,980 --> 02:55:07,980
So we're no longer updating these policies that were promised after this previous review.

3333
02:55:07,980 --> 02:55:10,980
We'd be able to see they'd be kept updated.

3334
02:55:10,980 --> 02:55:20,980
Similarly, there was requests in those questions for data regarding crime statistics across the city.

3335
02:55:20,980 --> 02:55:28,980
And the promise was made even though we couldn't get specific data that we would get annual reports that gave that information.

3336
02:55:28,980 --> 02:55:36,980
It's August 13th and we still don't have the newest stats.

3337
02:55:36,980 --> 02:55:45,980
And so I think that this shows a continuing problem with these long delayed reports.

3338
02:55:45,980 --> 02:55:53,980
And specifically with concerns regarding internal affairs and when those are being resolved, we're going a full year,

3339
02:55:53,980 --> 02:56:02,980
18 months if you have an incident early before those are getting reported, much less anything that can be followed up with by the council.

3340
02:56:02,980 --> 02:56:17,980
So again, I think that promises were made by this council by people who were either on this council then or serving in HPCIC at the time that these policies would be made public.

3341
02:56:17,980 --> 02:56:23,980
And again, we just continue to see that without actual statutes, we're not going to get transparency from HPD.

3342
02:56:23,980 --> 02:56:30,980
And so I look forward to the forum. I ask that you pass something.

3343
02:56:30,980 --> 02:56:34,980
Thank you, Mr. Chavez. It's good to see you again.

3344
02:56:34,980 --> 02:56:39,980
Mr. Meredith, are you still having your meeting on September 16th?

3345
02:56:39,980 --> 02:56:45,980
Yes, it's actually going to be a forum and it will be held here in council chambers at 4 p.m.

3346
02:56:45,980 --> 02:56:50,980
Obviously, maybe not obviously, but the public is more than welcome to come.

3347
02:56:50,980 --> 02:56:55,980
We'll be here till hopefully your last question is asked and answered.

3348
02:56:55,980 --> 02:56:59,980
Thank you. Are there any other business?

3349
02:56:59,980 --> 02:57:05,980
Do we have a motion motion to adjourn? We are adjourned. It is 826.

3350
02:57:05,980 --> 02:57:07,980
Thank you all for coming.
